{"seq":2,"slug":"point-pattern-analysis","title":"点模式分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/spatial-statistics/point-pattern-analysis","wordCount":1343,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"点模式分析\">点模式分析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>点模式分析（Point Pattern Analysis）研究空间中点事件（如犯罪事件、商铺位置、物种出现地）的分布规律。核心问题是判断点的分布是聚类、均匀还是随机，并量化聚类的程度和尺度。点模式分析是流行病学、犯罪学、生态学和零售选址中的重要工具。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[点模式分析] --&gt; B[一阶分析]&#10;    A --&gt; C[二阶分析]&#10;    B --&gt; D[核密度估计 KDE]&#10;    B --&gt; E[强度面]&#10;    C --&gt; F[Ripley&#39;s K 函数]&#10;    C --&gt; G[最近邻分析]&#10;    C --&gt; H[F/G/J 函数]\">graph TD\n    A[点模式分析] --&gt; B[一阶分析]\n    A --&gt; C[二阶分析]\n    B --&gt; D[核密度估计 KDE]\n    B --&gt; E[强度面]\n    C --&gt; F[Ripley's K 函数]\n    C --&gt; G[最近邻分析]\n    C --&gt; H[F/G/J 函数]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>检测内容</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核密度估计</td>\n<td>一阶</td>\n<td>强度变化</td>\n<td>点坐标</td>\n<td>密度栅格</td>\n<td>犯罪热力图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ripley&#39;s K</td>\n<td>二阶</td>\n<td>聚类/离散尺度</td>\n<td>点坐标</td>\n<td>K(d) 曲线</td>\n<td>生态空间格局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最近邻指数</td>\n<td>二阶</td>\n<td>全局聚类程度</td>\n<td>点坐标</td>\n<td>R 比值</td>\n<td>快速初筛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DBSCAN</td>\n<td>聚类</td>\n<td>密度簇</td>\n<td>点坐标</td>\n<td>簇标签</td>\n<td>事件聚类发现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"完全空间随机性基准\">完全空间随机性基准</h2><p>点模式分析的第一步是确立基准——完全空间随机（Complete Spatial Randomness, CSR）。CSR 是齐次泊松过程生成的点模式，具有两个特征：任意子区域内点数服从泊松分布（强度恒定），且各点之间相互独立（无交互作用）。</p>\n<p>所有统计检验都是将观测到的点模式与 CSR 对比。偏离 CSR 说明存在非随机机制：聚类意味着点之间存在吸引作用（或共享环境偏好），规则/离散意味着点之间存在排斥或竞争。</p>\n<p>判断是否偏离 CSR 通常使用蒙特卡洛模拟：在同一研究区域内生成大量 CSR 模拟，计算每次模拟的统计量，构建置信包络线。如果观测统计量落在包络线之外，则在对应显著性水平上拒绝 CSR 假设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核密度估计\">核密度估计</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;import geopandas as gpd&#10;from sklearn.neighbors import KernelDensity&#10;&#10;points = gpd.read_file(&quot;crime_points.shp&quot;)&#10;coords = np.column_stack([points.geometry.x, points.geometry.y])&#10;&#10;kde = KernelDensity(bandwidth=500, kernel=&#39;gaussian&#39;, metric=&#39;euclidean&#39;)&#10;kde.fit(coords)&#10;&#10;x_min, y_min, x_max, y_max = points.total_bounds&#10;xx, yy = np.meshgrid(np.linspace(x_min, x_max, 200),&#10;                      np.linspace(y_min, y_max, 200))&#10;grid_points = np.column_stack([xx.ravel(), yy.ravel()])&#10;&#10;log_density = kde.score_samples(grid_points)&#10;density = np.exp(log_density).reshape(xx.shape)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> geopandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.neighbors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KernelDensity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">points </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gpd.read_file(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"crime_points.shp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">coords </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.column_stack([points.geometry.x, points.geometry.y])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kde </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KernelDensity(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bandwidth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kernel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gaussian'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'euclidean'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kde.fit(coords)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x_min, y_min, x_max, y_max </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> points.total_bounds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">xx, yy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.meshgrid(np.linspace(x_min, x_max, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                      np.linspace(y_min, y_max, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grid_points </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.column_stack([xx.ravel(), yy.ravel()])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">log_density </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kde.score_samples(grid_points)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">density </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.exp(log_density).reshape(xx.shape)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>带宽选择方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>经验法则</td>\n<td>Silverman 公式</td>\n<td>计算简单</td>\n<td>不适应局部变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉验证</td>\n<td>最大化似然</td>\n<td>数据驱动</td>\n<td>计算量大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应带宽</td>\n<td>随密度变化</td>\n<td>细节更好</td>\n<td>实现复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>带宽选择是 KDE 最关键的参数决策。带宽过小会产生尖刺状的噪声密度面，对单个点过度敏感；带宽过大则过度平滑，掩盖了真实的密度结构。在犯罪分析等应用中，带宽的物理含义是&quot;事件的空间影响范围&quot;——例如 500 米的带宽意味着每个犯罪事件在方圆 500 米内产生密度贡献。</p>\n<p>边界效应也需要特别注意。当研究区域边界附近存在点时，标准 KDE 会低估边界处的真实密度（因为核函数的一部分被截断在区域外）。修正方法包括边界核方法、反射法和消化法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ripley-s-k-函数\">Ripley&#39;s K 函数</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pointpats import PointPattern, Genv, Kenv&#10;&#10;pp = PointPattern(coords)&#10;&#10;kenv = Kenv(pp, intervals=50, realizations=99)&#10;&#10;# K(d) &gt; 期望值 → 聚类&#10;# K(d) &lt; 期望值 → 离散&#10;# K(d) ≈ 期望值 → 随机\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pointpats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PointPattern, Genv, Kenv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PointPattern(coords)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kenv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Kenv(pp, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">intervals</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">realizations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># K(d) > 期望值 → 聚类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># K(d) &#x3C; 期望值 → 离散</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># K(d) ≈ 期望值 → 随机</span></span></code></pre></div><p>K 函数的定义：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>某点距离 d 内其他点的数量</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(d) = \\lambda^{-1} E[\\text{某点距离 d 内其他点的数量}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">某点距离</span><span class=\"mord\"> d </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内其他点的数量</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是点模式的整体强度（每单位面积的点数）。在 CSR 下，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(d) = \\pi d^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。K(d) 高于 CSR 期望表示在距离 d 下存在聚类。</p>\n<p>实践中常用 L 函数代替 K 函数进行可视化。L 函数定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(d) = \\sqrt{K(d)/\\pi} - d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，在 CSR 下 L(d) = 0，使得偏离程度更容易观察。L(d) &gt; 0 表示聚类，L(d) &lt; 0 表示离散。</p>\n<p>K 函数的一个重要优势是多尺度分析能力——它可以同时检测在不同距离尺度上的聚类或离散模式。一个点模式可能在小尺度上聚类（如商铺聚集在商业区），同时在大尺度上离散（商业区之间间隔分布）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空间聚类\">空间聚类</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.cluster import DBSCAN&#10;&#10;clustering = DBSCAN(eps=300, min_samples=5, metric=&#39;euclidean&#39;)&#10;labels = clustering.fit_predict(coords)&#10;&#10;points[&#39;cluster&#39;] = labels&#10;n_clusters = len(set(labels)) - (1 if -1 in labels else 0)&#10;noise_ratio = (labels == -1).sum() / len(labels)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.cluster </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DBSCAN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">clustering </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DBSCAN(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">eps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min_samples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'euclidean'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clustering.fit_predict(coords)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">points[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cluster'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labels</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_clusters </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(labels)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">noise_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).sum() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(labels)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>聚类算法</th>\n<th>适用形状</th>\n<th>需指定簇数</th>\n<th>噪声处理</th>\n<th>空间应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DBSCAN</td>\n<td>任意形状</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>自动标记</td>\n<td>犯罪/事故聚类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HDBSCAN</td>\n<td>任意形状</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>层次化</td>\n<td>复杂密度变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>K-Means</td>\n<td>球形</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>初步划分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ST-DBSCAN</td>\n<td>时空任意形状</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>自动标记</td>\n<td>时空事件聚类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DBSCAN 的两个核心参数 eps（邻域半径）和 min_samples（最小点数）直接影响聚类结果。eps 过小导致大量噪声点和碎片化的小簇，eps 过大导致不同聚类被合并。可以使用 k-距离图辅助选择：对每个点计算到第 k 个最近邻的距离，按距离排序并绘图，曲线的&quot;拐点&quot;对应合适的 eps 值。</p>\n<p>HDBSCAN 是 DBSCAN 的层次化扩展，只需指定 min_cluster_size 参数，通过构建互达距离树自动发现不同密度水平下的聚类结构。它对参数选择更加稳健，特别适合密度差异大的点模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>点模式分析区分一阶（强度变化）和二阶（点间交互）两个层面</li>\n<li>完全空间随机（CSR）是所有点模式统计检验的基准</li>\n<li>核密度估计是最直观的一阶分析方法，带宽选择是结果质量的关键</li>\n<li>Ripley&#39;s K 函数通过多尺度分析揭示不同距离下的聚类/离散程度</li>\n<li>L 函数是 K 函数的标准化版本，在 CSR 下值为 0，更便于解读</li>\n<li>DBSCAN 是空间点聚类的首选算法，不需要预设簇数且能自动识别噪声</li>\n<li>所有点模式分析方法都需要与完全空间随机（CSR）基准对比来判断显著性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"点模式分析","id":"点模式分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"完全空间随机性基准","id":"完全空间随机性基准"},{"level":2,"text":"核密度估计","id":"核密度估计"},{"level":2,"text":"Ripley's K 函数","id":"ripley-s-k-函数"},{"level":2,"text":"空间聚类","id":"空间聚类"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"空间自相关分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/spatial-statistics/spatial-autocorrelation"},"next":{"title":"克里金与空间插值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/spatial-statistics/kriging-and-interpolation"}}